{"2360100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Girl Frame", "steam_appid": 2360100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the stars become hunting grounds, do you choose to sink into desire or tear apart the darkness?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras/370eccfd8d708ae611919120d09ed5d5.avif?t=1769489872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras_big/370eccfd8d708ae611919120d09ed5d5.avif?t=1769489872 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sci-fi action game that combines roguelike survival shooting and mecha cultivation, with a &quot;vampire survivor&quot;-like fast-paced battle as the core, bringing an adrenaline-pumping interstellar survival experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras/aa383a7f6094030e8b2acce1cc9b8d12.avif?t=1769489872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras_big/aa383a7f6094030e8b2acce1cc9b8d12.avif?t=1769489872 width=1560 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras/47f8c520751132743008a28f3aa1be1c.avif?t=1769489872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras_big/47f8c520751132743008a28f3aa1be1c.avif?t=1769489872 width=1560 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protagonist team setting:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic interstellar, a team of interstellar pirates and smugglers quietly descended. They are adventurers driven by the temptation of rare resources. The team members have their own characteristics, including mecha experts, combat experts and spaceship experts. Faced with the threat of the ancient gods, they must not only survive in this interstellar, but also fight against the manipulation of the ancient gods and rescue the controlled beautiful girl combat mecha pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras/76e8ec2dfe9c220d220f3bcbc4f70bba.avif?t=1769489872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras_big/76e8ec2dfe9c220d220f3bcbc4f70bba.avif?t=1769489872 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay highlights:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival game in the eternal night: In the ruins of the mysterious galaxy, control the war mecha to fight against the tide of distorted creatures;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 basic weapons + 27 advanced craftable weapons, each with nearly 10 different enhancement branches, plus hundreds of passive skills for free combination! There's no limit to the build possibilities, so unleash your creativity and create your own invincible combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eternal choice of fall and redemption: rescue the mecha girl who is controlled by the mind, and unlock the combined ultimate move through &quot;neural synchronization&quot;;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep space base construction: collect resources, upgrade the mothership technology tree, unlock the mecha invisible force field/driver gene modification warehouse;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mecha, skills and weapons: choose different mechas, weapons and drivers according to your own fighting style. Do you activate the energy shield to play steadily, or stack the rampage module to become a battlefield meat grinder? Your tactical DNA will define the destruction of the entire galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual impact: Witness the distorted body that merges mechanical and biological tissues, presenting alternative horror under dynamic light and shadow;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras/621920c144e481c6c381277c1f0d68e3.avif?t=1769489872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras_big/621920c144e481c6c381277c1f0d68e3.avif?t=1769489872 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras/af6911cf1393d1ebf73aea8ce5371ab6.avif?t=1769489872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras_big/af6911cf1393d1ebf73aea8ce5371ab6.avif?t=1769489872 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join this galactic gamble-on the edge of madness and reason, rewrite the final equation for the survival of civilization!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the stars become hunting grounds, do you choose to sink into desire or tear apart the darkness?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras/370eccfd8d708ae611919120d09ed5d5.avif?t=1769489872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras_big/370eccfd8d708ae611919120d09ed5d5.avif?t=1769489872 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sci-fi action game that combines roguelike survival shooting and mecha cultivation, with a &quot;vampire survivor&quot;-like fast-paced battle as the core, bringing an adrenaline-pumping interstellar survival e