to fight against the tide of distorted creatures;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 basic weapons + 27 advanced craftable weapons, each with nearly 10 different enhancement branches, plus hundreds of passive skills for free combination! There's no limit to the build possibilities, so unleash your creativity and create your own invincible combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eternal choice of fall and redemption: rescue the mecha girl who is controlled by the mind, and unlock the combined ultimate move through &quot;neural synchronization&quot;;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep space base construction: collect resources, upgrade the mothership technology tree, unlock the mecha invisible force field/driver gene modification warehouse;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mecha, skills and weapons: choose different mechas, weapons and drivers according to your own fighting style. Do you activate the energy shield to play steadily, or stack the rampage module to become a battlefield meat grinder? Your tactical DNA will define the destruction of the entire galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual impact: Witness the distorted body that merges mechanical and biological tissues, presenting alternative horror under dynamic light and shadow;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras/621920c144e481c6c381277c1f0d68e3.avif?t=1769489872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras_big/621920c144e481c6c381277c1f0d68e3.avif?t=1769489872 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras/af6911cf1393d1ebf73aea8ce5371ab6.avif?t=1769489872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360100/extras_big/af6911cf1393d1ebf73aea8ce5371ab6.avif?t=17694898